{
  "slug": "tasktrace-mcp-plugin",
  "name": "Tasktrace Mcp Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Allows claude to connect to the TaskTrace desktop application's MCP Server.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `tasktrace-context` (This skill should be used when the user asks about their own recent or past work, or asks…), `tasktrace-knowledge` (This skill should be used when the user asks about what they know, what they have read, what…), `tasktrace-setup` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"set up tasktrace\", \"install tasktrace\", \"configure tasktrace\", \"tasktrace…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `tasktrace`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install tasktrace-mcp-plugin@claude-community` from `warrenronsiek/TaskTraceMCPPlugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
